# API7 - Server-Side Request Forgery
# NOT DETECTABLE from web-tier logs as configured. No rule is provided.
#
# Tested 24 Sep 2026: a POST supplying http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/
# as mechanic_api returned HTTP 504 after the outbound fetch timed out.
# No entry appeared in the crapi-web access log or error log.
#
# The crapi-workshop container log recorded the supplied URL in full at INFO
# level. Detection is therefore possible at the application tier, but
# requires ingesting container logs, which was outside this pipeline.
